<https://text2sparql.aksw.org/2025/corporate/queries/features/MIN> a <https://text2sparql.aksw.org/2025/corporate/queries/Feature> .

<https://text2sparql.aksw.org/2025/corporate/queries/features/OFFSET> a <https://text2sparql.aksw.org/2025/corporate/queries/Feature> .

